{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1493920-random-ephemeral-entity-generator-ghost-spirits-and-angels","id":1493920,"title":"Random Ephemeral Entity Generator: Ghost, Spirits, and Angels","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-28T11:56:26-07:00","id":1493920,"title":"Random Ephemeral Entity Generator: Ghost, Spirits, and Angels","content":"<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1KK8CKa-3bi2_O5vdwBIc4_n6XR5axDCTTO_bVURGunw/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Link to the Google Sheet.</a><br /> <br /> <b>IMPORTANT:</b> Must select File -&gt; Make a Copy in order to use. Otherwise you will be unable to generate new Ephemeral Entities of your own.<br /> <br /> Created by Awkward GM Corbin:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AwkwardGMCorbin/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AwkwardGMCorbin/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/AwkwardGMCorbin/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/c/AwkwardGMCorbin/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Not for sale or resale, 100% free. Please give Awkward GM Corbin credit if used for Actual Plays.<br /> <br /> <u><b>How I made it:</b></u><ul><li>All the in game text is from the <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/114078/World-of-Darkness-GodMachine-Rules-Update?affiliate_id=3340454\" target=\"_blank\">Free God-Machine Rules Update</a> so I hope that there is no issue with me reprinting the Manifestations and Numina here.</li> <li>Created sets of every permutation of stats for each Ephemeral Entity rank, then randomly selected from that list to generate Power, Finesse, and Resistance.</li> <li>Used SORTN(&lt;List&gt; ,&lt;# of Abilities entity has&gt;,,RANDARRAY(&lt;# of Abilities in List&gt;),) to generate a list of random abilities without duplicates.</li> <li><b>Bug:</b> I\u2019ve been unable to get Unfetter/Fetter to work properly (one requires the other to exist already). If I come up with a solution I\u2019ll update the sheet. For now you can replace Fetter or replace another manifestation with Fetter/Unfetter manually.</li> </ul>Feel free to modify to use for other Ephemeral Entity types, I've not added other types due to the rules for them being in other books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","user":"DontEatRawHagis","date":". 09-29-2022, 10:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-30T07:14:34-07:00","id":1494038,"title":"","content":"That is so helpful thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25516-pinkhaunt","name":"PinkHaunt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-01T10:42:21-07:00","id":1494101,"title":"","content":"Nice work!<br /> <br /> Personally, I've found that in random generators, a lot can be achieved by rolling a random Skill.<br /> This skill can be used to add some flavor to the random thing generated. It can provide some suggestions to its background, add some detail to make it more memorable, and help the ST to improvise.<br /> <br /> For example, say you are generating a random ghost. Rolling a skill may give ideas as to how the ghost manifests.<br /> Academics? <i>Books open and pages flutter in the ghost's presence.</i><br /> Animal Handling? <i>Characters hear the sound of crows, even though none can be seen.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26440-moonwhisper","name":"moonwhisper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26440_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-14T10:29:33-07:00","id":1508367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>moonwhisper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1493920-random-ephemeral-entity-generator-ghost-spirits-and-angels?p=1494101#post1494101\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nice work!<br /> <br /> Personally, I've found that in random generators, a lot can be achieved by rolling a random Skill.<br /> This skill can be used to add some flavor to the random thing generated. It can provide some suggestions to its background, add some detail to make it more memorable, and help the ST to improvise.<br /> <br /> For example, say you are generating a random ghost. Rolling a skill may give ideas as to how the ghost manifests.<br /> Academics? <i>Books open and pages flutter in the ghost's presence.</i><br /> Animal Handling? <i>Characters hear the sound of crows, even though none can be seen.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Great idea! I'll be using this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26991-dentedhelm","name":"Dentedhelm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26991_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-14T13:30:14-07:00","id":1508382,"title":"","content":"First, let me say this is awesome and I love it. Thank you for all this hard work. <br /> <br /> I found a slight bug in it, I rolled a rank 2 angel and got twilight, claim, and possession as my manifestations. As per the note in claim you have to have fetter as well as possession so that's an illegal pairing. I'm unsure if this is tied to the fetter / unfetter bug or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}